			"notes": "## Changes\n- Added new config options:\n  - Persist Staff Peripheral State after Shutdown\n  - Time in Ticks to Fully Replenish Staff Evaluation Limit\n  - Number of cast() Calls Allowed per Tick\n  - Exhaust cast() Call Limit on Mishap\n- State of `staff` peripheral is now persistent.\n- Waystone Reflection and Lodestone Reflection now work in computer casting environments\n- Mishap are now always printed in English as Lua errors on client\n- Addressed a lot of race conditions with `staff` methods\n- Added Ravenmind methods\n- Updated to last version of Hex Casting\n\n## Dependencies\n- [Hex Casting](https://ci.blamejared.com/job/petrakat/job/Hexcasting/job/1.21) 0.12.0-devel-pre-61 and later\n- [CC: Tweaked](https://modrinth.com/mod/cc-tweaked)\n- [Cloth Config](https://modrinth.com/mod/cloth-config)\n\n- [Fabric API](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api) required on Fabric\n- [Mod Menu](https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu) optional on Fabric"
		},
